WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.716
After they put on their sandals, Mandy realized something.

2
00:00:05.717 --> 00:00:11.390
"Seiko, we have no money to buy these," she said.

3
00:00:11.391 --> 00:00:15.214
"It is a gift," said Seiko.

4
00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:20.752
She said good-bye to her aunt and picked up her basket of flowers.

5
00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:25.211
They went back onto the street.

6
00:00:25.212 --> 00:00:31.393
"Did you come to Sendai with Shogun Ieyasu?" asked Seiko.

7
00:00:31.394 --> 00:00:36.148
"Who’s he?" asked Vinnie, forgetting about the general.

8
00:00:36.149 --> 00:00:40.213
Seiko looked at him strangely and said,

9
00:00:40.214 --> 00:00:44.634
"You do not know Shogun Ieyasu?"

10
00:00:44.635 --> 00:00:49.888
"Well, oh sure," said Vinnie nervously.

11
00:00:49.889 --> 00:00:56.674
"The shogun has come a long way to see Daimyo Masamune," said Seiko.

12
00:00:56.675 --> 00:00:59.909
"Why?" asked Mandy.

13
00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:09.206
"The shogun likes to visit all the daimyos in every district," she said, "to make sure they are obeying his orders."

14
00:01:09.207 --> 00:01:12.034
"What’s going on over there?"

15
00:01:12.035 --> 00:01:17.135
Vinnie pointed to a crowd buying colorful strips of paper.

16
00:01:17.136 --> 00:01:21.930
"People are getting ready for the Star Festival," Seiko said.

17
00:01:21.931 --> 00:01:27.094
"Sendai celebrates the festival better than any other town!"

18
00:01:27.095 --> 00:01:30.827
"Why are they decorating those trees?"

19
00:01:30.828 --> 00:01:39.052
Mandy noticed bamboo trees along the street with shiny pieces of paper hanging from their branches.

20
00:01:39.053 --> 00:01:45.899
"People write their wishes on paper and then tie them to the trees," explained Seiko.

21
00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:50.740
"The wind carries their wishes away and makes them come true."

22
00:01:50.741 --> 00:01:55.673
Seiko turned into a small street off the main road.

23
00:01:55.674 --> 00:01:58.239
The children followed.

24
00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:04.308
They finally came to a narrow road with two-story buildings on each side.

25
00:02:04.309 --> 00:02:08.236
"This is where I live," said Seiko.

26
00:02:08.237 --> 00:02:13.672
Bright and colorful fabrics hung from poles along the rooftops.

27
00:02:13.673 --> 00:02:17.483
They swayed with each gentle breeze.

28
00:02:17.484 --> 00:02:21.518
"What is this place?" asked Vinnie.

29
00:02:21.519 --> 00:02:25.075
"It’s my home and a dye factory.

30
00:02:25.076 --> 00:02:29.115
My family and another family all work together.

31
00:02:29.116 --> 00:02:35.972
We make the most beautiful kimono in all of Sendai," Seiko said proudly.

32
00:02:35.973 --> 00:02:38.743
She took them inside her home.

33
00:02:38.744 --> 00:02:45.170
Seiko’s parents and her brother were stirring the dyed cloth in large wooden vats.

34
00:02:45.171 --> 00:02:50.683
"The flowers I picked will be used to dye the fabric," said Seiko.

35
00:02:50.684 --> 00:02:54.013
She handed the flowers to her father.

36
00:02:54.014 --> 00:02:58.405
"What kind of flowers are they?" asked Mandy.

37
00:02:58.406 --> 00:03:02.741
"They are called safflowers," said Seiko.

38
00:03:02.742 --> 00:03:06.091
Mandy touched the dyed fabric.

39
00:03:06.092 --> 00:03:08.510
It felt soft and smooth.

40
00:03:08.511 --> 00:03:12.231
Seiko’s mother spoke to her daughter.

41
00:03:12.232 --> 00:03:17.170
"My mother will bring you some food and drink," said Seiko.

42
00:03:17.171 --> 00:03:20.004
"Thank you," said Vinnie.

43
00:03:20.005 --> 00:03:24.376
He remembered the rice at Master Masamune’s house.

44
00:03:24.377 --> 00:03:27.004
It had looked very good.

45
00:03:27.005 --> 00:03:33.066
A few minutes later Seiko’s mother appeared with two bowls on a tray.

46
00:03:33.067 --> 00:03:37.103
"Is that rice?" Vinnie asked eagerly.

47
00:03:37.104 --> 00:03:40.063
Seiko’s mother bowed to them.

48
00:03:40.064 --> 00:03:44.938
"I apologize. Only samurai are allowed to have rice.

49
00:03:44.939 --> 00:03:47.734
I can only offer porridge."

50
00:03:47.735 --> 00:03:51.411
Vinnie felt embarrassed for wanting rice.

51
00:03:51.412 --> 00:03:55.748
He took the bowls and bowed to Seiko’s mother.

52
00:03:55.749 --> 00:03:59.952
"This looks delicious!" he said.

53
00:03:59.953 --> 00:04:06.368
"Thank you very much."

